WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.540
See, my mother, she was a veteran of World War II, and so was her brother, my uncle.

2
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:12.280
When they came back to Baton Rouge from the war, it was very, very much a crude awakening for her.

3
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.220
She thought things would be a lot different.
